    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Documentation Ingestion\n\nThis branch handles external documentation URLs.\n\nThe HTML is fetched first, then converted into plain text\nbefore being passed to the summarization step.\n\nKeep extraction separate from the LLM step so the model\nreceives clean, predictable input.\n",
